(7734656, 1274934, 29535, '<td valign="top">I may be biased as this is right up my street, but this is wonderful. I think this is my winner &amp;#128077;&amp;#127995;</td>', 'I may be biased as this is right up my street, but this is wonderful. I think this is my winner &#128077;&#127995;', '2022-12-15 12:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734657, 1274834, 29535, '<td valign="top">Simple, perhaps too much so for a free study and yet it''s Christmas and the way you captured the lights behind in the background is just perfect. Perhaps santa''s face could be a tad lighter. Love it!</td>', 'Simple, perhaps too much so for a free study and yet it''s Christmas and the way you captured the lights behind in the background is just perfect. Perhaps santa''s face could be a tad lighter. Love it!', '2022-12-15 12:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734658, 1274928, 29535, '<td valign="top">This is just kinda cool. I like it!</td>', 'This is just kinda cool. I like it!', '2022-12-15 12:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734659, 1274944, 29535, '<td valign="top">Awesome. Sometimes I worry I''m being too harsh in my voting but THIS is how a relatively simple concept can be a stunning photo, perfectly-executed with both composition and exposure. Great job!</td>', 'Awesome. Sometimes I worry I''m being too harsh in my voting but THIS is how a relatively simple concept can be a stunning photo, perfectly-executed with both composition and exposure. Great job!', '2022-12-15 12:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734660, 1274908, 29535, '<td valign="top">I almost clicked too fast on this one. It''s truly a wonderful composition, perfect colour balance. What a great find and shot, as of now in my top three!</td>', 'I almost clicked too fast on this one. It''s truly a wonderful composition, perfect colour balance. What a great find and shot, as of now in my top three!', '2022-12-15 12:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734661, 1274935, 29535, '<td valign="top">Wonderful location and composition. I wonder what different weather conditions could bring out of this shot.</td>', 'Wonderful location and composition. I wonder what different weather conditions could bring out of this shot.', '2022-12-15 12:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734662, 1274950, 29535, '<td valign="top">This is a very cool piece. I voted without really appreciating it, and now I''m upping it by one. What good is a free study without bold shots like this? Well done.</td>', 'This is a very cool piece. I voted without really appreciating it, and now I''m upping it by one. What good is a free study without bold shots like this? Well done.', '2022-12-15 13:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734670, 1274959, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very fun!</td>', 'Very fun!', '2022-12-15 15:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734671, 1274914, 103142, '<td valign="top">Intriguing!</td>', 'Intriguing!', '2022-12-15 15:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734672, 1274941, 103142, '<td valign="top">Nice! Nit-pick - It seems like there''s too much empty space at the bottom. The bottom 1/4 doesn''t really add much to the photo, imo. You may have been trying to put it at the 1/3 mark? But I think cropping up from the bottom would have made a real difference. If you didn''t want it letter boxed, it could have gone in from the sides as well. I think it would have had a much stronger impact. The rest is awesome!</td>', 'Nice! Nit-pick - It seems like there''s too much empty space at the bottom. The bottom 1/4 doesn''t really add much to the photo, imo. You may have been trying to put it at the 1/3 mark? But I think cropping up from the bottom would have made a real difference. If you didn''t want it letter boxed, it could have gone in from the sides as well. I think it would have had a much stronger impact. The rest is awesome!', '2022-12-15 15:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734673, 1274954, 103142, '<td valign="top">I really don''t have much of a need for these balls, and rarely am impressed with their photos. But this is gorgeous because of the lighting, the colors and the tones. I love having my opinions be challenged!</td>', 'I really don''t have much of a need for these balls, and rarely am impressed with their photos. But this is gorgeous because of the lighting, the colors and the tones. I love having my opinions be challenged!', '2022-12-15 15:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734674, 1274949, 103142, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning! I love the negative space on the right, the look on the face, the falling snow. There''s only one thing I would have changed: I know it''s an overcast day, but I would have added a bit of warmth to the shot. They''re such a beautiful color, and while an overcast day cools things down a lot, there still should be some warmth to the tones, imo.</td>', 'Absolutely stunning! I love the negative space on the right, the look on the face, the falling snow. There''s only one thing I would have changed: I know it''s an overcast day, but I would have added a bit of warmth to the shot. They''re such a beautiful color, and while an overcast day cools things down a lot, there still should be some warmth to the tones, imo.', '2022-12-15 15:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734685, 1274914, 67145, '<td valign="top">one of my favourites in the challenge . <br/>i think its her beautiful smile and how i am not entirely sure if she is standing in those blocks or you have put her there .. <br/>this is just wonderful .. :)</td>', 'one of my favourites in the challenge . i think its her beautiful smile and how i am not entirely sure if she is standing in those blocks or you have put her there .. this is just wonderful .. :)', '2022-12-15 17:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734686, 1274877, 67145, '<td valign="top">i love this sort of image . <br/>black and white for starters .. then the contrast and the light . <br/>grungy .. <br/>its like you have turned what i imagine would be a mundane scene into something extremely atmospheric .. <br/>what i particularly love is in the light there''s a suggestion of what i''m not sure . is it a ghostly figure . :)</td>', 'i love this sort of image . black and white for starters .. then the contrast and the light . grungy .. its like you have turned what i imagine would be a mundane scene into something extremely atmospheric .. what i particularly love is in the light there''s a suggestion of what i''m not sure . is it a ghostly figure . :)', '2022-12-15 17:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
