(7735227, 1274819, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like being thrust into a story</td>', 'I like being thrust into a story', '2022-12-21 21:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735228, 1274956, 30049, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait.</td>', 'Lovely portrait.', '2022-12-21 22:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735229, 1274905, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ha.  At first glance I thought that was a zipper!</td>', 'Ha.  At first glance I thought that was a zipper!', '2022-12-21 22:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735231, 1274944, 30049, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene.  Wish you''d had the space to do a perspective adjustment, but you would have lost too much on the left after crop.  Lovely colors.</td>', 'Beautiful scene.  Wish you''d had the space to do a perspective adjustment, but you would have lost too much on the left after crop.  Lovely colors.', '2022-12-21 22:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735232, 1274934, 30049, '<td valign="top">So far this is my favorite of the challenge!  Love the light.</td>', 'So far this is my favorite of the challenge!  Love the light.', '2022-12-21 22:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735233, 1274945, 30049, '<td valign="top">Love the sense of scale the person and dog add to this.</td>', 'Love the sense of scale the person and dog add to this.', '2022-12-21 22:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735234, 1274877, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a print waiting to happen.  Nicely seen!</td>', 'This is a print waiting to happen.  Nicely seen!', '2022-12-21 22:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735235, 1274906, 30049, '<td valign="top">Astute title for this fun frame.</td>', 'Astute title for this fun frame.', '2022-12-21 22:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735236, 1274938, 30049, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene overall.  Feels just a bit warm (for a cold scene).  :-)</td>', 'Lovely scene overall.  Feels just a bit warm (for a cold scene).  :-)', '2022-12-21 22:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735237, 1274905, 173844, '<td valign="top">It''s real, but I''m enjoying this image as a mystifying abstract.  It feels anatomical, inside the body, yet it''s so much more.  It''s a package deal - the lines, including diagonals; a multitude of shapes, comfortably living together; the textures, the grain, the composition, the clarity.  Dynamic.  Wonderful in black and white.  A gem.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'It''s real, but I''m enjoying this image as a mystifying abstract.  It feels anatomical, inside the body, yet it''s so much more.  It''s a package deal - the lines, including diagonals; a multitude of shapes, comfortably living together; the textures, the grain, the composition, the clarity.  Dynamic.  Wonderful in black and white.  A gem.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2022-12-21 22:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735240, 1274877, 173844, '<td valign="top">Like a modern stage set.  Terrific lighting.  Lovely disposition of dark and light, reaffirming the power of black and white.  One can almost hear the murmuring of the audience awaiting the actors'' entrance.  A tour de force, and best parking garage photo I''ve ever come across.<br/>Second personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Like a modern stage set.  Terrific lighting.  Lovely disposition of dark and light, reaffirming the power of black and white.  One can almost hear the murmuring of the audience awaiting the actors'' entrance.  A tour de force, and best parking garage photo I''ve ever come across.Second personal favorite of the challenge.', '2022-12-21 22:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735241, 1274944, 5705, '<td valign="top">Love the wide angle and contrast. Excellent photo</td>', 'Love the wide angle and contrast. Excellent photo', '2022-12-21 22:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735243, 1274960, 5705, '<td valign="top">Great mood. Very surreal</td>', 'Great mood. Very surreal', '2022-12-21 22:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735244, 1274946, 5705, '<td valign="top">Sharp and great model</td>', 'Sharp and great model', '2022-12-21 22:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735245, 1274945, 5705, '<td valign="top">Love this focal length</td>', 'Love this focal length', '2022-12-21 22:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735246, 1274522, 5705, '<td valign="top">Great moment. Love it</td>', 'Great moment. Love it', '2022-12-21 22:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735247, 1274954, 5705, '<td valign="top">Looks like a a painting.  I love it.</td>', 'Looks like a a painting.  I love it.', '2022-12-21 22:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735248, 1274905, 5705, '<td valign="top">Is it a zipper or a fantastic wide angle.</td>', 'Is it a zipper or a fantastic wide angle.', '2022-12-21 22:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735249, 1274928, 173844, '<td valign="top">Clever, fetching sleight of hand.  The sand, sea and sunset and two casually placed people throw viewers for a loop as their shadows transform the background to a vertical wall.  There''s a subtle, unsettling further twist in the peoples'' shadows, as they fall in opposite directions.  Easy to see this image in a museum.<br/>Beautifully accomplished.</td>', 'Clever, fetching sleight of hand.  The sand, sea and sunset and two casually placed people throw viewers for a loop as their shadows transform the background to a vertical wall.  There''s a subtle, unsettling further twist in the peoples'' shadows, as they fall in opposite directions.  Easy to see this image in a museum.Beautifully accomplished.', '2022-12-21 22:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735250, 1274954, 173844, '<td valign="top">The image within the glass globe is startlingly beautiful and mysterious, which is enough in itself.  In its setting it''s fascinating many times over.  The modest palette is lovely.  Haunting, given to yearning, pushing at revelation.  You''re an alchemist.</td>', 'The image within the glass globe is startlingly beautiful and mysterious, which is enough in itself.  In its setting it''s fascinating many times over.  The modest palette is lovely.  Haunting, given to yearning, pushing at revelation.  You''re an alchemist.', '2022-12-21 23:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735251, 1274957, 173844, '<td valign="top">It''s amazing what you''ve constructed out of shards and a seemingly slight overlay.  Even if the placement of the shards isn''t random, it sure looks as if it is, a tough trick in itself.  A modest, endearing palette.  It seems like you''ve held back, which takes confidence and imagination.  Lessons abound.  Fine.</td>', 'It''s amazing what you''ve constructed out of shards and a seemingly slight overlay.  Even if the placement of the shards isn''t random, it sure looks as if it is, a tough trick in itself.  A modest, endearing palette.  It seems like you''ve held back, which takes confidence and imagination.  Lessons abound.  Fine.', '2022-12-21 23:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735252, 1274949, 173844, '<td valign="top">The hawk''s (I figure) pose is wonderful.  The branch, topped with snow, likewise.  I especially like how the cryptic pattern on the hawk''s back is akin to that of the bark.  Must have been enchanting to see this.</td>', 'The hawk''s (I figure) pose is wonderful.  The branch, topped with snow, likewise.  I especially like how the cryptic pattern on the hawk''s back is akin to that of the bark.  Must have been enchanting to see this.', '2022-12-21 23:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735253, 1274935, 173844, '<td valign="top">My first impression of this panorama is one of peacefulness.  It''s a dream, let''s see this out together.  I think the repetition of the bridge, the settled fog and the grayness of the day induce such a feeling.  This image is a fine antidote for fretting and inner commotion.</td>', 'My first impression of this panorama is one of peacefulness.  It''s a dream, let''s see this out together.  I think the repetition of the bridge, the settled fog and the grayness of the day induce such a feeling.  This image is a fine antidote for fretting and inner commotion.', '2022-12-21 23:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735254, 1274945, 173844, '<td valign="top">The beauty of the moment, the dance of circumstance.  The three dominating trees can almost be a tryptic, with a fine bonus of someone walking the dog.  The background fog nicely sets off the foreground.<br/>Fine image.</td>', 'The beauty of the moment, the dance of circumstance.  The three dominating trees can almost be a tryptic, with a fine bonus of someone walking the dog.  The background fog nicely sets off the foreground.Fine image.', '2022-12-21 23:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735255, 1274914, 173844, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful place for a wedding shoot.  The happy brides and their photographers must be lined up awaiting their chances.  The forms are symmetric, but feel maze-like.  Kind of like marriage.  Lovely image.</td>', 'What a wonderful place for a wedding shoot.  The happy brides and their photographers must be lined up awaiting their chances.  The forms are symmetric, but feel maze-like.  Kind of like marriage.  Lovely image.', '2022-12-21 23:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735256, 1274934, 173844, '<td valign="top">Refreshing.  A summer delight.</td>', 'Refreshing.  A summer delight.', '2022-12-21 23:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7735257, 1274522, 173844, '<td valign="top">So brimming with happiness.  A delight to see.</td>', 'So brimming with happiness.  A delight to see.', '2022-12-21 23:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
